# Real per-player/world evidence collected by P6.3 -- large and/or private
# (contains real Minecraft account UUIDs, inventories, and world state).
# The live world folders (Paper/, campack/) and every world_slots/*/world.zip
# stay local-only; provenance/hashes for all of it are recorded in
# manifest.json instead, which IS committed. See README.md's "P6.3 real
# evidence collected" section.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!manifest.json

# world_slots/ itself holds only small, non-sensitive metadata (a slot UUID
# marker, slot.json) alongside the large/private world.zip -- un-ignore the
# directories so those small files can be tracked; world.zip stays covered
# by the blanket "*" above since it's never explicitly un-ignored.
!world_slots/
!world_slots/*/
!world_slots/active_slot_id.txt
!world_slots/*/slot.json
